module metric

# Port of crystal-metric's metric.cr to iyi: twenty-six benchmarks, each of
# which checks its own answer against the one the Crystal program prints.
# `bench/metric_port.sh` builds it and requires every answer, which makes it
# a whole-library correctness check - float printing, `Random`, BigInt,
# regex, JSON, Complex, channels - as much as a benchmark.
#
#   iyi build --release -o metric metric.iyi && ./metric
#   ./metric Brainfuck2
#   ./metric Brainfuck,Brainfuck2
#
# What had to change against the Crystal original is written down beside the
# code that changes.
